WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.320
It's because of

00:01.400 --> 00:02.680
Yu Gong's seditious poem

00:02.800 --> 00:03.760
I heard this man

00:03.840 --> 00:05.240
Is proud and aloof

00:05.440 --> 00:07.107
Hard to get along with

00:08.440 --> 00:10.107
Are you close to him?

00:11.280 --> 00:12.480
Rise and answer

00:12.560 --> 00:13.800
Thank you, Father

